a&_nc_ohc=jrbkxvLgad4Q7kNvwEXOjI1&_nc_oc=AdrtEjqw2j-RirKK4Phy7_BfW3VLVv0B8IgrnvWDznTj8FQbFnjydLYx_3B5tOiHamI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_MI-2vB4aFTMD6fWtUp_4hH4V4932tQnSOpOmiDIdmqw&oe=6A466F64"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PUB_Breathedge_Landscape_2560x1440_rev.png", "id": "707115611531757", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974696_707115621531756_849882076632584654_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OtqOCB9ivVoQ7kNvwFS1q4v&_nc_oc=Adq1QY3oUsj0dAJoiQV2cN9RtnnlTmNHHZxzGkotnD4v_fTloCqOxyyixaJbQOmnybQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9LXVsuCC3IaqKV9xuCVofLFpvf4jtqzjSetwi2fZWKgw&oe=6A4678E2"}, "display_name": "Breathedge: Cosmic Cluck", "keywords": ["survival", "space", "astronaut", "spaceship", "universe"], "long_description": "In Breathedge: Cosmic Cluck you\u2019ll be able to:\n\n- Come back home.\n\n- Listen to an in-depth commentary on anything from a crazy Chicken.\n\n- Craft a versatile multitool that makes it so convenient to throw garbage at enemies and pull yourself to asteroids and shipwrecks... you've always dreamed of a grappling hook, haven\u2019t you?\n\n- Explore outer space and collect all the garbage that has been dumped into it by humankind... and an evil, very EVIL corporation.\n\n- Visit the space farms of an athlete, a hippie, and a criminal mastermind.\n\n- Fight a boss whose appearance you couldn't possibly have a clue about... well okay, you could, you just refused to believe it.\n\n- Save the UNIVERSE... okay, just the farm, but oh man, what a salvation it'll be!\n\nJoin the Man in his space adventure and your virtual reality will become much more real than ever before.", "short_description": "Survive in outer space! Breathedge: Cosmic Cluck is a Retro-Futuristic Adventure with a talking Chickens your main companion.\n\nFill your pockets with junk, build the Universal Survival Tool, blast the